<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I felt like the Orange test didn't really relate to its circle as well as the others clearly did. While rushing water could indicate the Phlegethon and the moving trees are clearly the sinners who committed suicide, I couldn't place any allusions to the burning desert/Third Ring, nor could I immediately associate the forest/cabin with violence. Could you explain your thoughts on this test to me?</p>
<p>Also I like that the demons/Satan are the stone sarcophagi. I wonder if because the D-Class percieves the corpses as sinners, they see the sarcophagi as demons too?</p>
